[10.8,"o","  ᚱᚢᚾᛖ rune · your runes, deployed\r\n  0.6.0 (8919cb32b) built 2026-10-26T21:38:02Z\r\n\r\n  Flow:\r\n    setup       [--plan | --yes]                                      Guided first-run configuration\r\n    init        <SLUG_OR_DIR> [--with <NAMES>] | --module <DIR>       Scaffold a project from a skeleton, or a deck module\r\n    target      [SLUG_OR_PATH|-] [--list]                             Bind or show the working repository\r\n    add         <ID[,ID...]>                                          Add runes to the consumer manifest\r\n    skill       add <NAME[,NAME...]> | install | show                 List or stage skills; ship the rune agent skill\r\n    agent       [add <NAME[,NAME...]>]                                List or stage agents by name\r\n    rule        [add <NAME[,NAME...]>]                                List or stage rules by name\r\n    hook        [list | record [stats|import] | add <NAME[,NAME...]>] Print the hook plan, read the hook record, or stage hook runes\r\n    context     [--json]                                              Agent-ready brief of the working context\r\n    tui         [--source <DIR>] [--edit]                             Launch the terminal dashboard\r\n    dashboard   [--source <DIR>] [--port <PORT>]                      Launch the read-only web dashboard\r\n    install     [--source <DIR>] [--target <DIR>]                     Assemble and deploy rune content\r\n    review      list | export [--target <DIR>]                        Inspect or export TUI review comments\r\n\r\n  Spec:\r\n    spec        propose | list | glossary | fix | doctor | archive    Spec-driven change lifecycle under docs/\r\n\r\n  Deck:\r\n    discover    [QUERY]                                               Find community decks by GitHub topic\r\n    status      [--source <DIR>]                                      Show deck, spec, change, and deploy status\r\n    doctor      [--target <DIR>] [--verify]                           Check deployment integrity\r\n    repair      [--root <DIR>] [--target <DIR>] [--dry-run]           Repair doctor findings: trash orphans, rename subjects, restore files\r\n    draft       <KIND> <NAME> | --list | --drop <NAME>                Write an unmanaged rune into the provider trees and register it in .drafts\r\n    promote     <NAME> --domain <DOMAIN> --change <ID>                Move a draft into the deck and open its change\r\n    validate    [--source <DIR>]                                      Validate deck or rune files against schemas\r\n    graph       export [--source <DIR>]                               Export the artifact graph as Turtle for SHACL validation\r\n    proof       scaffold <CHANGE> | run <CHANGE> [--check | --instruction <KEY>]Scaffold, run, and check a change's behavior proof\r\n    drift       [--source <DIR>] [--upstream <DIR> | --target <DIR>]  Compare source, build, and deployment drift\r\n    provenance  [--target <DIR_OR_FILE>]                              Show deployed-file provenance\r\n    clean       [--source <DIR>] [--target <DIR>]                     Remove stale installed files\r\n    release     [DOMAIN] [--source <DIR>]                             Package rune release tarballs\r\n    sign        [--amend | --tag <TAG> | --verify [REF] [--seal]]     Seal the branch, sign tags, verify against KEYS\r\n    sign queue  [<BOOKMARK> --receipt <FILE>] [--prune]               Queue a validated head for the key, or list the queue\r\n    sign open   <BOOKMARK> [--body-file <FILE>] [--queue]             Open-seal a draft pull request into the owner's name\r\n    sign submit <BOOKMARK> --receipt <FILE>                           Queue a reviewed head for the merge-seal\r\n    sign next   | all | show | drop <BOOKMARK> | adopt <N>            Sign from the queue base first; inspect, withdraw, adopt\r\n    import      <URL> [--module <DIR>]                                Import an upstream rune with provenance\r\n    adopt       start|...|finalize|abandon|reseal|doctor              Adopt an upstream rune through block-by-block review\r\n    move        <FROM> <TO> [--root <DIR>]                            Move a reviewed artifact with its provenance\r\n    bench       run|report|list|dashboard|doctor|audit                Run and report SkateBench-compatible benchmark suites\r\n    provider    [enable|disable <name>]                               List or toggle deploy providers\r\n    todo        [add|do|ls|obsidian|import]                           Repo tasks in TODO.txt with an Obsidian transform\r\n    adr         new|list|supersede|index                              Architecture decision records under docs/decisions\r\n    docs        check|dev                                             Docs tree checks and a local mint preview\r\n    watch       <COMMAND>                                             Manage monitored rune locations\r\n\r\n  Plumbing:\r\n    plugin      [list]                                                List declared plugins and their events\r\n    update      --check                                               Check for a newer release (read-only)\r\n    assemble    [--source <DIR>]                                      Assemble rune content into build/\r\n    deploy      [--source <DIR>] [--target <DIR>]                     Deploy assembled runes\r\n    copy        --source <DIR> --target <DIR>                         Copy runes without transforms\r\n    config      [set <KEY> <VALUE>]                                   Resolved configuration (deck, targets, lore, artifacts)\r\n    find        <QUERY>                                               Find local runes by relevance\r\n    exec        <SKILL> [-- ARGS...]                                  Run a script bundled with a skill\r\n    launch      <TOOL> [-- ARGS...]                                   Launch a coding tool with middleware\r\n    run         <TOOL> [PROMPT|--prompt-file <FILE>]                  Run a coding tool with supervised output\r\n    queue       post <TOOL> --session <ID> [MESSAGE] | read | list    Post and read messages between sessions\r\n    completion  install [SHELL] | print <SHELL>                       Shell completions (bash|zsh|fish|nushell)\r\n\r\n  Quick start:\r\n    rune init N4M3Z/demo --with rust,tool\r\n    rune target N4M3Z/demo\r\n    rune add development\r\n    rune tui --edit\r\n    rune install\r\n\r\n  rune <command> --help for flags and details\r\n   next         rune setup\r\nexit 0\r\n.\r\n./home\r\n"]
